481068.overview:
The NitroNimbus mod of Data East's 1990 pinball table for Visual Pinball X makes a significant number of changes including:

 • New playfield artwork, replacing the illustrations from the original table with high quality images from the film; 
 • New plastics, lighting, and models; 
 • Animations; 
 • An AltSound pack offering better quality audio than found on the original machine;
 • A PuP pack with video clips from the film;
 • An optional 88mph skill shot timer borrowed from SLAMT1LT's ULTIMATE Pro edition for Future Pinball.
